# One shell line that proves this project still works.
#
# It runs after every code edit, and again when a subagent tries to report done
# - a subagent cannot finish while this is red. Keep it under ~60s: typecheck
# plus unit tests is usually the right level, a full e2e suite is not.
#
# Everything here is a comment, so no verification is configured yet and both
# hooks stay out of the way. Uncomment one line, or write your own.
#
#   npm run typecheck && npm test -- --run
#   pnpm -s build
#   pytest -q && ruff check .
#   cargo check --quiet
#   dotnet build --nologo -v q
